The bug arises from conflicting default port values in the `DelegateToFileSystem` class, where the method `getDefaultPortIfDefined` incorrectly returns `-1` when no default port is defined, leading to ambiguity in port handling. This inconsistency can cause issues when different file systems expect specific default port values, potentially resulting in connection failures or misrouting of requests.

