Reason:
The method `getDefaultPortIfDefined` returns `-1` when no default port is defined (i.e., when `defaultPort` is `0`), which creates ambiguity in port handling. This inconsistency can lead to different file systems misinterpreting the default port value, potentially causing connection failures or misrouting of requests.

